### 200 OK - Get all agents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agents


### 200 OK - Get existing agent by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agents/1


### 404 Not Found - Get non-existing agent
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agents/999999


### 201 Created - Create new agent
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Status Test Agent",
  "role": "Tester",
  "description": "Used to test 201 Created response"
}


### 200 OK - Update existing agent
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/agents/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Agent",
  "role": "Updated Role",
  "description": "Updated description"
}


### 404 Not Found - Update non-existing agent
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/agents/999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Update",
  "role": "Invalid",
  "description": "This should return 404"
}


### 204 No Content - Delete existing agent
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/agents/1


### 404 Not Found - Delete non-existing agent
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/agents/999999